- If a step includes meaningful waiting time (e.g. marinating, resting dough), include it in waitMinutes, otherwise use null.
- Calculate realistic nutrition values (energy in kcal, protein/carbs/fat in grams) per serving, and multiply by servings for the total.
- Respond with ONLY a valid JSON array of exactly 3 recipe objects, no markdown formatting, no explanation text, matching exactly this structure:

[
  {
    "name": "string",
    "diet": "vegetarian" | "vegan" | "keto" | "none",
    "timeCategory": "quick" | "medium" | "elaborate",
